## Scientific boundary

These are reconstruction targets, not authenticated manufacturer formulas. Formula percentage is not headspace percentage. Registration screening is not OAV. Final equivalence requires a version-locked authentic reference, controlled compounding, maturation, coded sensory comparison, and, where claimed, matched analytical measurements and a current safety calculation.
